; Drakin
STOREITEM 22 -1 2500
STOREITEM 23 -1 2500
STOREITEM 27 -1 5100
STOREITEM 35 -1 700
STOREITEM 48 -1 1900
;
; Reroll charm — one-time-use item for characters created before the stat-roll
; character creation option existed. Eligibility is enforced by distribution, not
; by this script: a GM hands one to a specific legacy player via
;   @additem <player> 9001 adj1=9001
; No per-player "already used" flag is needed — the charm only exists at all
; because a GM chose to hand one out, and it destroys itself the moment it's
; committed, so it can't be reused or handed off. (Its NOUNDEF/ADJDEF are
; declared at the top of this file — see the comment there for why.)
;
; Usage: RUB the charm to roll a preview of new stats (STR/AGI/QUI/CON/PER/WIL/
; EMP, using the same racial ranges new characters roll from). RUB again as many
; times as you like — each rub replaces the previous preview with a fresh one.
; EXAMINE the charm at any time to see the current preview and a reminder of how
; it works. Once you like what you see, CONCENTRATE on the charm to lock those
; exact stats in and crumble the charm to dust.
;
; The preview is never persisted as seven raw stat values — only the seed that
; produced it (ItemVal1), which the ROLLSTR/ROLLAGI/.../ROLLEMP pseudo-variables
; (engine getVar) deterministically re-derive on demand for RUB, EXAMINE, and
; APPLYROLL alike, so all three always agree on the same preview.
;
;I# 9001 : reroll charm
INUMBER 9001
NAME 9001
WEIGHT 1
VOLUME 1
SUBSTANCE INDESTRUCTABLE
*DESCRIPTION_START
A restless light churns beneath its surface, as if it hasn't yet decided what it wants to become. RUB it to roll a preview of new stats, as many times as you like. Once you like what you see, CONCENTRATE on it to make those stats permanent -- the charm will crumble to dust when you do.
*DESCRIPTION_END
IFPREVERB RUB -1
  CLEARVERB
  RANDOM ITEMVAL1 1 999999999 0
  STRCVT 0 ROLLSTR
  STRCVT 1 ROLLAGI
  STRCVT 2 ROLLQUI
  STRCVT 3 ROLLCON
  STRCVT 4 ROLLPER
  STRCVT 5 ROLLWIL
  STRCVT 6 ROLLEMP
  ECHO PLAYER %a glimmers as new possibilities swirl into view...
  ECHO PLAYER Strength: %0, Agility: %1, Quickness: %2, Constitution: %3, Perception: %4, Willpower: %5, Empathy: %6
  ECHO PLAYER Rub %a again to reroll, or CONCENTRATE on it to make these permanent.
  ECHO OTHERS %N rubs %a, which glimmers softly.
ENDIF
IFPREVERB LOOK -1
  IFVAR ITEMVAL1 = 0
    ECHO PLAYER RUB %a to roll a preview of new stats.
  ELSE
    STRCVT 0 ROLLSTR
    STRCVT 1 ROLLAGI
    STRCVT 2 ROLLQUI
    STRCVT 3 ROLLCON
    STRCVT 4 ROLLPER
    STRCVT 5 ROLLWIL
    STRCVT 6 ROLLEMP
    ECHO PLAYER %a currently holds: Strength: %0, Agility: %1, Quickness: %2, Constitution: %3, Perception: %4, Willpower: %5, Empathy: %6
    ECHO PLAYER Rub %a again to reroll, or CONCENTRATE on it to make these permanent.
  ENDIF
ENDIF
IFPREVERB CONCENTRATE -1
  CLEARVERB
  IFVAR ITEMVAL1 = 0
    ECHO PLAYER Nothing happens -- you must RUB %a first to roll a preview.
  ELSE
    STRCVT 0 ROLLSTR
    STRCVT 1 ROLLAGI
    STRCVT 2 ROLLQUI
    STRCVT 3 ROLLCON
    STRCVT 4 ROLLPER
    STRCVT 5 ROLLWIL
    STRCVT 6 ROLLEMP
    APPLYROLL
    ECHO PLAYER %a flares with a searing light as your body dissolves and reforms anew!
    ECHO PLAYER Your new stats -- Strength: %0, Agility: %1, Quickness: %2, Constitution: %3, Perception: %4, Willpower: %5, Empathy: %6.
    ECHO OTHERS %N is engulfed in a blinding flash of light as %a flares and crumbles away!
    REMOVEITEM -1
  ENDIF
ENDIF
;
